      "text": "Now let's add a drum to our sequence. We can trigger the drum on individual notes.\n\nTo Do:\n* In the Filter box, enter \"drum\" then drag a drumFM module into the patch.\n* Connect the drumFM \"aOut1\" jack to the lineOut.\n* Connect some of the individual jacks on the right hand side of the seq8 module to the drumFM \"trigger\" jack.\n* Drag on the drum's pitch jack to raise it to around 57.\n* Increase the \"mcRatio\" and \"depth\" jacks as well.\n",
